sense:
The four great rivers coming from the four directions of Mt. Kailash.
1. {gang+ga} The Ganges from the opening of a rock like an elephant to the east;
2. {sin+d+hu} the Sindhu from the opemng of a rock like a peacock to the south;
3. {pak+Shu/} the Pakshu from the
opening of a rock like a hor...
